@startuml
title PEGASUS dialogue summarizer — modular pipeline and inference
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
folder "SAMSum dialogues + summaries" as Dataset
[Data ingestion] as Ingest
[Validation] as Validate
[Tokenization / transformation] as Transform
[PEGASUS fine-tuning] as Train
[Model evaluation] as Eval
database "Saved model + tokenizer" as Model
actor "Local API caller" as Client
[FastAPI /predict] as API
[PredictionPipeline] as Predict
[Generated text summary] as Summary
Dataset --> Ingest
Ingest --> Validate
Validate --> Transform
Transform --> Train
Train --> Eval
Train --> Model
Client --> API : dialogue
API --> Predict
Model --> Predict
Predict --> Summary
note bottom of Summary
A generated summary needs human review.
Dockerfile exists; no cloud service claimed.
end note
@enduml
